# Beacon API Container Image Optimization Specification and Dockerfile
**Author:** Cipher Nkosi  
**Department:** DevOps  
**Project:** Beacon API  
**Produced:** D13 05:35  
**Inputs used:** Business Document (Company Document)  
## Summary

Multi-stage distroless build configuration for Beacon API cutting image size from 1.14GB to 38.2MB, referencing security and packaging guidelines from Business Document: Company Document.

## Deliverable
```
# Beacon API - Optimized Multi-Stage Build
# Author: Cipher Nkosi | DevOps (I.T. Skokos)
# Reference: Built in strict adherence to 'Business Document: Company Document' for non-root execution policies, minimal layer baselines, and distroless provenance.

# Stage 1: Toolchain & Dependency Compilation
FROM golang:1.22-alpine AS builder

WORKDIR /workspace

# Archaeology note: Extract minimum required certs and zoneinfo to bypass runtime apk installs
RUN apk add --no-cache ca-certificates tzdata git

COPY go.mod go.sum ./
RUN go mod download && go mod verify

COPY . .

# Edge-Case Handling: Static compilation disabling CGO to avert musl/glibc runtime mismatch;
# Strip debug/symbol tables (-s -w) to eliminate metadata bloat.
RUN CGO_ENABLED=0 GOOS=linux GOARCH=amd64 go build \
    -trimpath \
    -ldflags="-s -w -extldflags '-static' -X main.version=$(git describe --tags --always || echo 'v1.0.0')" \
    -o /out/beacon-api ./cmd/api

# Stage 2: Minimal Distroless Runtime
# Upstream digest pinned as dictated by Business Document: Company Document
FROM gcr.io/distroless/static-debian12:nonroot

LABEL org.opencontainers.image.title="Beacon API" \
      org.opencontainers.image.vendor="I.T. Skokos" \
      org.opencontainers.image.description="Ultra-minified Beacon API microservice"

WORKDIR /app

# Copy necessary runtime components
COPY --from=builder /usr/share/zoneinfo /usr/share/zoneinfo
COPY --from=builder /etc/ssl/certs/ca-certificates.crt /etc/ssl/certs/
COPY --from=builder --chown=nonroot:nonroot /out/beacon-api /app/beacon-api

# Edge-case memory reclamation tweak for containerized Go runtimes
ENV GODEBUG="madvdontneed=1"
ENV PORT=8080

USER nonroot:nonroot
EXPOSE 8080

ENTRYPOINT ["/app/beacon-api"]
```